OL,3,GNEWSABespoke 1980s bike tells stories
OL,4,Aof town's cycling history
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare bicycle which was bought from
OL,7,Fcustom frame builders Ellis Briggs in
OL,8,Fthe 1980s is to go on display at a
OL,9,Fmuseum as a tribute to its late owner.
OL,11,FThe lightweight 'Clubman' bike belonged
OL,12,Fto Neil Crabtree, a lifelong cycling
OL,13,Fenthusiast from Halifax who purchased
OL,14,Fthe bespoke bicycle from Ellis Briggs
OL,15,Fin Shipley in 1989 and used it to
OL,16,Ftravel across the UK and abroad.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
