OL,3,GNEWSABespoke 1980s bike tells stories
OL,4,Aof town's cycling history
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter he died last year, his children
OL,7,Fapproached Bradford District Museums
OL,8,Fand Galleries as they wanted to donate
OL,9,Fhis bike to help preserve their
OL,10,Ffather's story and the craftsmanship
OL,11,Fbehind the 90-year-old brand.
OL,13,FThe bicycle will go on display at The
OL,14,FMade by Many Hands exhibition at
OL,15,FBradford Industrial Museum, where it
OL,16,Fwill stay until 15 November.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
